                                "sense_id": "08538d5f-2902-3bc9-9cae-eee7ae6af936",
                                "text": "With a thought I tooke for Maudline\n& a cruse of cockle pottage.\nwith a thing thus tall, skie blesse you all:\nI befell into this dotage."
